      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE EL (5) made an early move to take the lead then dug deep but found one a shade too good last start over 1600m at this track. Failed twice at similar trip to this last prep but they were at Listed level. Cherry ripe at the third run back and this looks a most appealing assignment. BAILED (1) continues to race well five runs into his maiden campaign. Best recent effort was two back when he took out a Class 1 over 1880m at Devonport Synthetic. Strong SP profile of late so expect him to be pretty short again. LAST TREMBLE (4) is racing well but still only has one win from 23 starts. Going well including a one-length third over 2100m at Hobart three back when coming off a one-month break. Sure to be thereabouts again. IRISH BLOOM (6) has been freshened up since a poor effort over 1880m at Devonport Synthetic a month ago. One for the exotics. OPENSEA (2) ran a better race last start and should be peaking this evening at the fourth run back.",
